---
import SectionGlow from "./SectionGlow.astro";
---

<section id="municipalidad" class="relative overflow-hidden py-24">
  <SectionGlow flip />
  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div class="reveal mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
    <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald">Para la Municipalidad</span>
    <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">
      Beneficios directos para su gestión
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-14 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
    <div
      class="reveal rounded-2xl border border-emerald/25 bg-emerald/5 p-7 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-emerald/50"
    >
      <div class="grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-emerald text-petrol shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(80,200,135,0.3)]">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"
          ><path
            d="M12 1v22M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H7"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg
        >
      </div>
      <h3 class="mt-5 font-bold text-white">Aumento de Ingresos Permanentes</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/60">
        Cada nuevo microempresario formalizado se convierte en un contribuyente activo de patentes comerciales,
        publicidad y aseo comunal, año tras año.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="reveal rounded-2xl border border-teal/25 bg-teal/5 p-7 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-teal/50"
    >
      <div class="grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-teal/15 text-teal">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"
          ><path
            d="M3 3v18h18M7 15l3.5-4 3 3L18 8"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.8"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg
        >
      </div>
      <h3 class="mt-5 font-bold text-white">Dashboard para Fomento Productivo</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/60">
        Visualice en tiempo real un mapa de calor con los rubros emergentes en su comuna, zonas de mayor actividad y
        tasas de éxito de formalización.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="reveal rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-7 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-white/30"
    >
      <div class="grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-white/10 text-white">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"
          ><path
            d="M12 6v6l4 2"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.8"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"
          ></circle></svg
        >
      </div>
      <h3 class="mt-5 font-bold text-white">Reducción Drástica de Tiempos de Espera</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/60">
        Automatice el 80% de las consultas repetitivas de orientación, liberando a los ejecutivos de ventanilla
        para casos complejos.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>
